-- Seed: 20 dummy reviewers + their reviews of DJ Ivo (display_name
-- 'ivaylotsachev'), for testing the ratings/reviews UI (radar chart, the
-- preview + "show more" expand tile, etc.) with a realistic volume of data.
--
-- Run once in the Supabase SQL Editor, AFTER the `profile_reviews` table
-- from schema.sql has been created. Same dummy-auth.users trick as
-- seed_djs.sql: inserting into auth.users fires on_auth_user_created,
-- which auto-creates the matching public.profiles row.
--
-- Safe to re-run — both inserts are guarded by ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING.

